  "task": "We're opening a new UX Designer role in the Design team. Please create the headcount requisition and publish the job posting, then create a candidate profile for Emily Rodriguez, update her status to interview, and schedule her interview with the design leads. After the interview, record feedback and if positive, advance her to offer stage, generate the offer letter, route it for approval, and initiate background and reference checks."
